      "disclaimers": [],
      "quotes": [
        {
          "t": 31.9,
          "text": "empowering customers and consultants to create tests in a more agile, quicker, and cost-effective way."
        },
        {
          "t": 60.4,
          "text": "But in this release, we are now moving the page scripting from preview into making it generally available."
        },
        {
          "t": 73.3,
          "text": "it's now fully localized. Every user-facing string is translated, all steps, error messages, tooltips,"
        },
        {
          "t": 98.1,
          "text": "So, now it's ready for broad production use across all languages."
        },
        {
          "t": 111.7,
          "text": "First, we have support for multiple selection in grids, so that you can record selecting several rows in a list and run bulk actions"
        },
        {
          "t": 133.5,
          "text": "And that turns the recording into actually a real assertion, not just a sequence of clicks."
        },
        {
          "t": 149.4,
          "text": "it's now also possible to actually use agents to try to generate"
        }
